{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/joined()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/joined()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Element"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sequence"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"extendedModule":"Swift","title":"joined()","externalID":"s:STsST7ElementRpzrlE6joineds15FlattenSequenceVyxGyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"joined"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s15FlattenSequenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"FlattenSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"Cliques","relatedModules":["Swift"]}]},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Inherited from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sequence.joined()"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"joined"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s15FlattenSequenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"FlattenSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]}],"references":{"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"title":"Cliques","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","role":"collection","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/cliques"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"title":"MaximalCliques","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering"},{"type":"text","text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"degeneracy d."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}]},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/joined()":{"title":"joined()","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"joined"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s15FlattenSequenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"FlattenSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","te